P. Terry,
In your example, the GR_txdb object is the query, not the subject, in 
the overlap calculation. The following code should get you what you are 
looking for:

OL<- findOverlaps(GR_txdb, r_gr_ChSeqPks)
tdata<- GR_txdb[queryHits(OL),]



Patrick


